<p>Choose from <strong>seven character races and eight classes</strong>. Battle <strong>hundreds of monsters throughout 80+ zones</strong> and embark on <strong>thousands of quests</strong> in a game world filled with a huge array of weapons and items. This world is rich with history and lore.</p>
